import D5.S0.Tower.TribonacciPeriodicNine.EnumerationNineValid

/- Library-search audit trail (2026-08-18):
   * The calc shape is the one the period-eight low-arm proofs use, reused
     rather than re-derived.
   * Two shapes are needed, not one: the recorded low state lies on the left
     branch of the arm minimum for fourteen orbits and on the right branch for
     the twelve K, O, P, Q, R, S, T, U, W, X, Y, Z.  Which branch applies was
     measured per orbit, not assumed; an earlier draft used a different and
     wrong twelve and the K case failed to close. -/

